name = "Kirnale's Journals (Second Job Change)"
description = "When you inquired about the Second Job, Saki told you about Kirnale, the legendary explorer. Upon hearing of Kirnale's exploits, you wanted to see the long lost Portable Sundial and Kirnale's Compass for yourself. There's a good chance that Krawfy King in Kenji's Beach may have these items..."
